vidence by default / link only what a thesis directly concerns, omit the rest) with one decidable rule, and the request's closing line no longer invites an empty answer (extraction.EMPTY_LINE_FROM). The admission reasons stay v12's. Version 12 (D184, 2026-10-26): identical entries to version 11; the version exists because the extraction schema gains the admission fields (opens_as, folds_into, lost_if_folded, settled_by; code, extraction.admission_schema) and role-v12 states the four reasons a candidate may open. Version 10 (D167, 2026-10-25): identical to version 9; the version exists because the extraction schema's measure vocabulary gains market_size and project_cost (code, extraction.MEASURES_V10), so requests under v10 differ from v9 and the archive keeps them apart. 05-extraction.md: block 2 (what this category is and how to read it, from the classification rules) and block 4 (what to read out of it), same entries as categories-v6; version 9: declared groups carry aliases so code decides group identity and membership (D166); research groups only for ongoing matters, not for a company's own financial lines (D149/D164). Enum values come from the response schema.",
